<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Ahmedabad To Noida Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an Ahmedabad to Noida interstate move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the original GST invoice, a signed packing list, an e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and insurance paperwork. Shree Ashirwad also prepares a route‑specific clearance form for each checkpost, ensuring smooth transit without delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect delicate items during the 1014 km journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a protective barrier: 80‑GSM bubble wrap cushions shocks, high‑density foam shields edges, corrugated sheets prevent punctures, stretch film guards against moisture, and custom wooden crates secure fragile pieces. This systematic approach reduces breakage risk by over 90 % on long‑haul routes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the Ahmedabad to Noida transport service covered by insurance?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage throughout the journey, and you receive a claim settlement within 48 hours if any incident occurs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my household goods in real time during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All Shree Ashirwad container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS units that provide live location updates via a secure portal. You can monitor progress, estimated arrival times, and any checkpost stops, ensuring full transparency from Ahmedabad to Noida.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the final cost of an Ahmedabad to Noida relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Final pricing depends on total volume, distance, vehicle size (18ft, 22ft, or 32ft), packing material usage, insurance coverage, and any special handling requirements such as piano or antique transport. Seasonal demand and fuel surcharge may also affect the tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure safety at highway checkposts?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The company follows IBA‑approved protocols, pre‑arranges clearance documents, and assigns a dedicated logistics coordinator to liaise with authorities. Vehicles are inspected before each checkpoint, and all cargo is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings to prevent shifting during inspections.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
